<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Hi All<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:5.25pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Th=
is is the weekly test report for Yocto 1.3 20120515 build. QA tested all QE=
MUs and BSPs, as well as ADT. Only one issue found in this build, the X ser=
ver can not startup on qemuarm/qemumips/qemuppc/ememlow.
 For ADT, QA checked the basic functions of adt-installer, meta-toolchain, =
poky build tree and eclipse tools, they all perform well.<span style=3D"col=
or:#1F497D">
</span>&nbsp;But the later build of 20150515-2 on poky/master, commit ID f3=
ba3cb6af96aebf5167bb1565edf11cceb7897f, the x86 meta-toolchain build failed=
 on autobuilder due to a parallel make issue with telepathy-glib, reported =
as bug 2462.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:10.5pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US">No=
te: The test report is archived @
<a href=3D"https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_1.3_Weekly_Test_Report"=
